  <p style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #475569; line-height: 1.5;"><em>Note: The table above illustrates valuation scenarios for educational modeling and does not represent fixed buyback or redemption cash guarantees. Actual realized value is determined by award inventory, flight taxes, fuel surcharges, transfer ratios, and individual airline award charts. For program-specific details, explore our valuation guides for <a href="/en/values/chase-ultimate-rewards/">Chase Ultimate Rewards</a>, <a href="/en/values/amex-membership-rewards/">Amex Membership Rewards</a>, <a href="/en/values/aeroplan-points/">Air Canada Aeroplan</a>, or read our in-depth <a href="/en/guides/airline-miles-value/">Airline Miles Value Guide</a> and <a href="/en/methodology/">Valuation Methodology</a>.</em></p>

