  <h3>Frequently Asked Questions</h3>
  <div class="faq">
    <details>
      <summary>What should I do if my points are about to expire?</summary>
      <div>
        <p>For programs that extend expiration with activity, you can reset the clock with a small purchase on a co-branded card, transferring a small number of points, or earning miles through an online shopping portal.</p>
      </div>
    </details>
    
    <details>
      <summary>Can I sell my airline miles for cash?</summary>
      <div>
        <p>Many loyalty programs restrict or prohibit unauthorized sale or barter of points. Review the applicable program terms before transferring or using rewards for another person.</p>
      </div>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>Does this calculator cash out my points?</summary>
      <div>
        <p>No. This calculator is strictly an informational tool to estimate purchasing power. We do not buy, sell, or process points redemptions.</p>
      </div>
    </details>
